{"english":[{"by":"machine","text":"Well, blowing over $30,000 was bound to be fun."}],"id":"103e0073b81dee49","jyutping":"e6 saai1 zo2 saam1 maan6 gei2 man1 gang2 hai6 hou2 waan2 laa1","jyutpingBy":"corpus","text":"誒，嘥咗三萬幾蚊梗係好玩喇。","words":[{"jyutping":"e6","pos":"e","text":"誒"},{"jyutping":"saai1","pos":"v","text":"嘥"},{"jyutping":"zo2","pos":"u","text":"咗"},{"jyutping":"saam1 maan6 gei2","pos":"m","text":"三萬幾"},{"jyutping":"man1","pos":"q","text":"蚊"},{"jyutping":"gang2 hai6","pos":"d","text":"梗係"},{"jyutping":"hou2 waan2","pos":"a","text":"好玩"},{"jyutping":"laa1","pos":"y","text":"喇"}]}
